  "sourceAcceptanceCriteria": [
    "terminal sessions clear local custody and redirect once to login with explicit expired state and one normalized same-origin return path",
    "identity and session-storage outages render a controlled retryable unavailable state without clearing the browser session or creating a redirect loop",
    "parallel requests and browser tabs serialize refresh-token rotation and permit at most one refresh and one request replay",
    "the browser never receives or forwards access or refresh tokens",
    "fresh MFA gates the exact retained high-risk actions",
